# Day 37/60 — AI Task Compass

## Objective

Today I built an AI Task Compass, an interactive application that helps users organize work, assign task ownership, improve collaboration, and understand organizational workflows through workplace simulations.

The experience focuses on structured decision-making, efficient task routing, and teamwork using interactive challenges.

