## What I Learned

### Clear Ownership Improves Productivity

Assigning clear responsibilities reduces confusion and improves team efficiency.

### Better Collaboration Requires Structure

Organized workflows make communication smoother and help teams complete work faster.

### AI Can Simulate Workplace Scenarios

Interactive simulations provide practical ways to understand project management and organizational thinking.

### Decision-Making Benefits from Visualization

Dashboards and workflow tracking make it easier to identify bottlenecks and improve performance.

